      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "LOEWE has just unveiled its 2026 Fall Men's collection, with the Puzzle bag once again taking center stage. New iterations include the Featherlight Puzzle shoulder bag in supple nappa lambskin and a version in black paper calf leather. The Amazona 180 and Loop Hobo bags are reimagined in suede this season, infusing them with a vintage, elegant air.",
