    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The Featherlight Puzzle large handbag is crafted from soft, lightweight nappa lambskin, retaining the iconic geometric panels and three-dimensional \"puzzle\" silhouette. It features slimmer metal hardware to reduce weight, with bottom studs replaced by a modern diagonal design. The bag comes with a removable balloon dice charm and a concealed leather luggage tag pocket. The detachable, adjustable strap allows for hand-carry, shoulder, or crossbody wear. Available in black and terracotta with palladium-toned hardware, the nappa leather offers a细腻触感 and luminous sheen, while the soft shape adds a laid-back, casual vibe.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
