    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "This season also introduces the new Featherlight Puzzle Sling shoulder bag, which streamlines the classic Puzzle into a compact, elongated silhouette while preserving its signature geometric lines. The bag's capacity can be adjusted via a snap button at the base. Available in black and dark chestnut, the nappa lambskin body is lightweight and contours to the body. The adjustable strap enables shoulder or crossbody wear.",
