    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The oversized Amazona 180 handbag is rendered in golden brown suede with chocolate leather trim, reviving the classic colorway of the original 1975 Amazona. Another version features black calfskin with a golden suede lining, and a single Toron rolled handle lends a relaxed vibe. The main compartment uses a hidden magnetic closure, so even with the top zipper open, valuables stay secure—or zip it up for a more formal look.",
